  "name": "ONIA — Pipeline Llamada → Propuesta",
  "description": "Receives Telegram voice notes, transcribes with Whisper, extracts client data with GPT-4o-mini, generates an HTML proposal, and sends both a summary and the proposal file back via Telegram.",
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": true,
